# SCP — requirements.lock.txt [A3 supply-chain lockfile]
#
# LÀ GÌ: full `pip freeze` từ container scp-scp-api-1 (image build từ
# scp/requirements.txt đã pin 100% `==`). Ghi toàn bộ transitive deps ở
# version ĐANG CHẠY THẬT để build reproducible (CWE-1357 / SLSA).
#
# CÁCH DÙNG:
#   pip install -r scp/requirements.lock.txt          # install đúng môi trường lock
#   docker compose -f compose.yml build scp-api && \
#     docker compose -f compose.yml up -d scp-api     # rebuild từ requirements.txt
#   docker compose -f compose.yml exec scp-api pip freeze > scp/requirements.lock.txt
#                                                     # re-lock sau khi đổi deps
#
# LƯU Ý: requirements.txt = source of truth cho direct deps (có comment lý do);
# lockfile = snapshot full env. Khi nâng cấp deps: sửa requirements.txt →
# rebuild → re-freeze lockfile (không sửa lockfile tay).
# Freeze tại: 2026-10-02 01:40 local, container scp-scp-api-1 (image scp-api:local
# build từ requirements.txt [AUDIT-R2 2026-10-01] trên commit 583edc5a).
# [AUDIT-R2] Security pins: PyJWT 2.15.0, anyio 4.14.2, urllib3 2.8.0,
# cryptography 50.0.0, starlette 1.3.1, fastapi 0.142.2, idna 3.15,
# python-dotenv 1.2.2, requests 2.33.0 — đối chiếu khớp pip freeze live.
# [AUDIT-R2 2026-10-02] PyJWT 2.14.0 -> 2.15.0 (PYSEC-2026-4141, pip-audit).

